s6-1-p46 : Block
s6-1-p46 = prose (cons "There are four objects worth distinguishing operationally, without turning them into new semantic categories: a request occurrence, the producer it refers to, the reusable result of that producer, and delivery or adaptation of that result to the occurrence. Multiple occurrences may share one producer. Reusing the producer's work does not make delivery and adaptation free." nil)
